<div class="head"><div><h1>Controlled Billing & Payment Adjustments</h1><div class="sub">Edit a bill while it is still uncollected, or use debit/credit adjustments and receipt reversal/refund once a payment exists, so receivables, allocations, receipts, and journals remain reconciled.</div></div><a class="btn light" href="billing_management.php">Back to Billing</a></div>
